  topicId: depletion
  title: Depletion & V0
  summary: Diffusion and recombination uncover fixed + donor ions (N) and - acceptor ions (P), creating a depletion field N->P and built-in potential V0 = VT * ln(NA*ND/ni^2) (~0.69 V for Si).
